      "Learn how agency owners and software founders built their businesses.",
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Business Opportunity Network",
    Icon: LuHandshake,
    color: "yellow",
    points: [
      "Refer clients and share new projects with members.",
      "Find partners who can do work under your brand.",
      "Work with other members on larger projects.",
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Exclusive Member Directory",
    Icon: LuContactRound,
    color: "green",
